  "prompt": "# Core Summary\nTwo elegant women pose together at a formal banquet hall in a single continuous medium shot with a gentle zoom in. The clip captures their confident smiles and contrasting floral attire against a softly focused background of crystal chandeliers and white panel walls, creating a polished, celebratory portrait moment.\n\n# Scene\n[shot1][00:00-00:05]\nOrnate indoor banquet hall with white panel walls and decorative arches. Cascading crystal chandeliers hang from the ceiling, casting warm, diffused light. Background features white chairs, tables with bottles, and potted plants, all rendered in soft focus (bokeh) to emphasize the foreground subjects. Lighting is warm and even, creating a luminous atmosphere with subtle rim light on the subjects.\n**Audio Description**: Soft ambient murmur of a crowd, distant clinking of glass, and a faint, elegant instrumental melody (piano and strings) swelling gently.\n\n# Subjects Description\n- **<ID_A>**: Female, young adult. Wears a colorful abstract floral dress with vibrant hues. Hair styled in an elegant updo. Skin tone warm, makeup polished.\n- **<ID_B>**: Female, young adult. Wears a delicate light lavender dress with floral appliqués. Hair styled in loose elegant waves. Skin tone fair to medium, makeup natural and radiant.\n- **Vocal Characteristics**: N/A (No dialogue).\n\n# Dynamic Narrative\n[shot1][00:00-00:05]\nMedium shot, straight-on angle. <ID_A> stands on the left, <ID_B> on the right, shoulders touching, both facing directly toward the camera. Camera performs a slow, smooth zoom in, tightening the frame from waist-up to chest-up. <ID_A> and <ID_B> maintain confident, joyful smiles, eyes engaging with the lens. Subtle head tilts and natural breathing movements add life to the pose. Warm key light highlights their cheekbones and hairstyles, while the background chandeliers twinkle softly out of focus. The zoom concludes with their expressions filling more of the frame, emphasizing intimacy and celebration.\n\n# Style, Color & Aesthetics\nCinematic portrait style with a shallow depth of field. Color palette features warm whites, soft lavenders, and vibrant floral accents against a creamy bokeh background. Lighting is high-key but soft, avoiding harsh shadows, with a focus on skin texture and fabric detail. Image quality is sharp on subjects, dreamy in background.\n\n# Atmosphere & Emotion\nJoyful, polished, and intimate. The scene conveys a sense of celebration and close friendship, enhanced by the warm lighting and elegant setting. The gentle zoom creates a feeling of drawing the viewer into their happy moment.",
